kan_ft_ofl2.traineddata

Based on kan.traineddata by the Tesseract OCR project, from
https://github.com/tesseract-ocr/tessdata_best (the file at commit
9ddc24e750eec0994223a9edc3fcb434a2244f3b, unchanged since), which the
repository licenses under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Modifications copyright 2026 Prasad Subrahmanya and Open Kannada contributors.

What changed, in November 2026: the LSTM network was trained further on
Kannada text lines, and the character set was extended. The word, number and
punctuation lists are unchanged.

The model file is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; see
LICENSE-MODEL. Anyone who redistributes it should include LICENSE-MODEL and
this NOTICE.

The network was trained on material under CC BY-SA 3.0 and 4.0. Whether that
makes the model an adaptation of that material is an open question, explained
in https://github.com/openkannada/kannada-ocr/blob/v0.1.0/docs/model-card.md.
The material was changed for training: scans were cut into line images, some
of them downscaled; texts were normalized with kannadi and split into lines,
and some lines were rendered in fonts and degraded to look like print.

